      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FORTY'S BOY (1) was sent out big odds last time but scored an upset win in a Grade 5 at Wentworth Park (30.53). Has a good record at this journey. Has a strong record from this draw, notching two wins and four minor placings from six starts. Hard to go past. SABINA SPARKLES (8) doesn't win out of turn. Finished in the minors latest when third (30.13) at Wentworth Park and may be close to breaking through. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Hard to beat again. SUNBURNT KEEPER (7) is having his first start around this track. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 1.75 lengths (29.98) at The Gardens. Some good form is emerging from his last run. A big run wouldn't surprise.",
